    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing an Embedding Provider**\n\nI'm zeroing in on Google Cloud Vertex AI and its `textembedding-gecko` model. I need to make sure I include the model's identifier in the Python script `embed_batch.py`.\n\n\n**Constructing the Embedding Script**\n\nI'm now diving into the specifics of `embed_batch.py`. I'm going to leverage the `google.cloud.aiplatform` library for integration. The plan involves initializing Vertex AI, acquiring the embedding model (`textembedding-gecko`), and crafting a function to efficiently generate embeddings for text batches. I'll include example texts to test the function.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789866316578,
          "start": 1789866314015
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc58891f0017D1a7HhaT8GpfF",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc5884b4001pgHvmX3qs28xmX",
      "session_id": "ses_f43a77b61ffeUVUvRVPT3xsrGx",
      "time_created": 1789866314015,
      "time_updated": 1789866316579
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "SXOaEp3CGhG1yPse",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import vertexai\nfrom vertexai.language_models import TextEmbeddingModel\n\ndef embed_batch_texts(texts: list[str]) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Generates embeddings for a batch of texts using Vertex AI's TextEmbeddingModel.\"\"\"\n    vertexai.init(project=\"YOUR_PROJECT_ID\", location=\"us-central1\") # Replace with your project ID and desired location\n    model = TextEmbeddingModel.from_pretrained(\"textembedding-gecko\")\n    embeddings = model.get_embeddings(texts)\n    return [embedding.values for embedding in embeddings]\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    example_texts = [\n        \"This is an example text.\",\n        \"Another text for embedding.\",\n        \"Vertex AI provides powerful machine learning services.\"\n    ]\n    \n    # NOTE: Replace \"YOUR_PROJECT_ID\" with your actual Google Cloud Project ID\n    # and ensure Vertex AI API is enabled in your project.\n    # Also, make sure you have authenticated to Google Cloud (e.g., using `gcloud auth application-default login`)\n    # before running this script.\n\n    try:\n        batch_embeddings = embed_batch_texts(example_texts)\n        for i, embedding in enumerate(batch_embeddings):\n            print(f\"Embedding for text '{example_texts[i]}': {embedding[:5]}...\") # Print first 5 dimensions\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"An error occurred: {e}\")\n        print(\"Please ensure you have replaced 'YOUR_PROJECT_ID' with your actual Google Cloud Project ID,\")\n        print(\"the Vertex AI API is enabled, and you are authenticated to Google Cloud.\")\n",
            "filePath": "embed_batch.py"
          },
