      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing the Code**\n\nI've just finished the `embed_batch.py` script. It's built with `vertexai` and uses `textembedding-gecko`, making it easy to see it utilizes Google Cloud Vertex AI. I made sure to leave helpful comments for users setting up their environment.\n\n\n**Completing the Script**\n\nI've finished the `embed_batch.py` script. It's built with `vertexai` and leverages `textembedding-gecko`, making the provider clear. I included detailed comments for user environment setup, including a reminder to change the placeholder project ID. This concludes my work on this task.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
