      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Embedding Provider**\n\nOkay, I've decided to use the `openai` library to generate text embeddings. I'll be using the `text-embedding-ada-002` model specifically. Now I'm focused on integrating this into a Python script, named `embed_text.py`.\n\n\n**Implementing Embedding Functionality**\n\nI'm now in the process of implementing the embedding functionality within `embed_text.py`. The focus is on incorporating the `openai` library to generate embeddings. The `text-embedding-ada-002` model is the chosen tool. I will ensure the code explicitly imports `openai` and identifies the specific model being used.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789866311918,
          "start": 1789866310358
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc587ad6001ic5gwoK5TFf3SN",
